# ThreadSanitizer suppressions (TSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=...), used by the tsan-threads target of dm/host/tests.
# Each exception names its reason; real host races are fixed, not listed here.
# Not a finding: aout.pos (hle_audio.c, pull) passes from the AudioUnit's render thread to the silent sink (null_sink) or to the closing thread (au_release_pending)
#   across AudioOutputUnitStop, which returns after the render callback; TSan cannot see that wait (CoreAudio is not instrumented). t_audio
race:^null_sink$
race:^au_release_pending$
# Not a finding: t_condvar ends with _exit and does not join its waiter and reader (in the old-order variant the waiter is never woken)
thread:t_condvar.c
